{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50858","headline":"省题诗二十一首 上德不德 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 上德不德","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何从称上德，舍德德方全。\n圣者如非圣，贤者不自贤。\n海甯言我广，神岂谓予玄。\n伐善功难立，无爲化易宣。\n[道]惟闻邃古，理亦愧先天。\n欲述犹龙旨，应忘得意筌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}